    "text": [
        {
            "jpName": "メジロマックイーン",
            "enName": "Mejiro McQueen",
            "jpText": "ライアンっ！　この前の試合の実況中継は\r\nもうご覧になられましたか！？",
            "enText": "Ryan! Have you had a chance to see \nthe game from the other day?!",
            "nextBlock": 2,
            "voiceIdx": 0,
            "pathId": -3872896710234227981,
            "blockIdx": 1
        },
        {
            "jpName": "メジロマックイーン",
            "enName": "Mejiro McQueen",
            "jpText": "9回裏2アウト満塁！　絶体絶命の大ピンチ！\r\nからの華麗な大逆転――",
            "enText": "Bottom of the ninth, two outs and \nall bases loaded! They were positively \ncornered! Yet somehow they pulled off \nthe most miraculous ——",
            "nextBlock": 3,
            "voiceIdx": 1,
            "pathId": -3196752999079135741,
            "blockIdx": 2
        },
        {
            "jpName": "メジロライアン",
            "enName": "Mejiro Ryan",
            "jpText": "あっ……マ、マックイーン。\nちょっと落ち着いて。ね？",
            "enText": "Ah… M-McQueen, calm down, okay?",
            "nextBlock": 4,
            "voiceIdx": 2,
            "pathId": 6531071851917096782,
            "blockIdx": 3
        },
        {
            "jpName": "メジロマックイーン",
            "enName": "Mejiro McQueen",
            "jpText": "いいえ、落ち着いてなんていられませんわ！\r\nあの興奮を思い出したら、私……！",
            "enText": "I most certainly will not! Just thinking \nabout that moment makes me…!",
            "nextBlock": 5,
            "voiceIdx": 3,
            "pathId": -8298913221420509922,
            "blockIdx": 4
        },
        {
            "jpName": "メジロライアン",
            "enName": "Mejiro Ryan",
            "jpText": "待って待って！\r\n今はほら、他の子に聞こえちゃうよ……？",
            "enText": "Stop, stop! Do you really wanna talk about \nthis where people can hear you…?",
            "nextBlock": 6,
            "voiceIdx": 4,
            "pathId": -5983462343502103272,
            "blockIdx": 5
        },
        {
            "jpName": "メジロマックイーン",
            "enName": "Mejiro McQueen",
            "jpText": "……………………はっ！",
            "enText": "…………<i>Ah!</i>",
            "nextBlock": 7,
            "voiceIdx": 5,
            "pathId": -7558497943347531692,
            "blockIdx": 6
        },
        {
            "jpName": "メジロマックイーン",
            "enName": "Mejiro McQueen",
            "jpText": "う、うふふ。なんでもありませんわ。\r\nメジロのウマ娘はいつだって優雅に、です。",
            "enText": "A-Ahaha. Whatever do you mean? \nA Mejiro would never be having \nany unrefined conversation…",
            "nextBlock": 8,
            "voiceIdx": 6,
            "pathId": 7011961637812080751,
            "blockIdx": 7
        },
        {
            "jpName": "メジロマックイーン",
            "enName": "Mejiro McQueen",
            "jpText": "そうだ。ライアン、お茶会に参りませんか？\r\n私、ちょうどいい茶葉をいただきまして――",
            "enText": "That reminds me, I just received \nthe most wonderful tea leaves. \nWhy don't we go have some?",
            "nextBlock": 9,
            "voiceIdx": 7,
            "pathId": -3953478987239215054,
            "blockIdx": 8
        },
        {
            "jpName": "メジロライアン",
            "enName": "Mejiro Ryan",
            "jpText": "あははっ、そうだね。\nじゃ、お茶会に行こうか！",
            "enText": "Ahaha, so that's your cover, huh? \nAll right, let's go have some tea!",
            "nextBlock": 10,
            "voiceIdx": 8,
            "pathId": -4885274808623940627,
            "blockIdx": 9
        },
        {
            "jpName": "メジロマックイーン",
            "enName": "Mejiro McQueen",
            "jpText": "ええ、はい！\nあくまで『お茶会』ですわ……！",
            "enText": "Y-Yes! Tea… That's all we're doing!",
            "nextBlock": -1,
            "voiceIdx": 9,
            "pathId": -3779483145890768380,
            "blockIdx": 10
        }
    ],
